  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></math> be a triangle such that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">a</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mover><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">c</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>,</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mover><mi>b</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">c</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn></math> Consider the statements :</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>:&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">b</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">b</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8736;</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>cos</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><msqrt><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></msqrt></mfenced></math>. Then</p>"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "both <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>are true",
