  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>We know that by triangle law of vector addition,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">b</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">c</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#8594;</mo></mover></math></p><p>Squaring both side we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p>Now putting the given value&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>.</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn></math></p><p>We get,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>36</mn></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mover><mi>c</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math></p><p>Now,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></math></p><p>And&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#8594;</mo></mover></math></p><p>Squaring both side we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced><mi>cos</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>&#8736;</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>72</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>24</mn><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt><mi>cos</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>&#8736;</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>36</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>cos</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>&#8736;</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>48</mn><mrow><mn>24</mn><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></msqrt></math></p></blockquote>"
  }
